#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-modules/gi-docgen.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Gi-DocGen</application> is a document generator for GObject-"
"based libraries. GObject is the base type system of the GNOME project. Gi-"
